# Trial-Size Trial by Lightning (battlefield.trial_size_trial_by_lightning, CloisterOfStorms, a BattlefieldQuest; 15 minutes, one player
# capped at 20, the MiniTuningForkOfLightning required, Lightning_Protocrystal the exit). A level 20 Summoner with the quest accepted and the fork.
# The trade to LP_Entrance: the menu 32000. Updates: 0 and an area past the zone's arenas: REQS_NOT_MET; the fight's
# option, area 1: registered, entered (the fork taken). The boss of arena 1 killed: WON; the win: 32001; its finish:
# the battlefield's onEventFinishWin (and the quest's handler). After the cleanup, out.
lists CloisterOfStorms/LP_Entrance/onTrade CloisterOfStorms/onEventUpdate/32000 CloisterOfStorms/onEventFinish/32000 CloisterOfStorms/onEventFinish/32001
char zone=CloisterOfStorms pos=533.5,-14.9,492.0 job=SMN lvl=20
quest OtherAreas.TrialSizeTrialByLightning accepted
item MiniTuningForkOfLightning
login
trade LP_Entrance MiniTuningForkOfLightning x1  # the fork: the menu 32000
update 32000 option=0                   # 0: ignored
update 32000 option=36                  # past the arenas: REQS_NOT_MET
update 32000 option=33                   # area 1: registered, entered, the fork taken
finish                                  # in the arena
kill LIGHTNING_GREMLIN+6                  # the boss of arena 1: WON; 32001
finish                                  # the battlefield's finish
tick 11000                              # the won arena's cleanup
tick 10000                              # out of the battlefield
